.venv
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
# At every depth: a bare name matches only at the top of the folder.
**/__pycache__
tests
# Settings files hold secrets and stay on the laptop; the image gets its settings from
# docker-compose or the task definition.
.env*
# The Ministry's raw downloads stay on the laptop; only the small catalog file ships.
data/moph/pages
data/moph/*.xls
data/moph/*.xlsx
data/moph/*.log
# The no-prescription list's PDF and the rows read from it: catalog.csv carries the mark.
data/moph/*.pdf
data/moph/otc_list.csv
# OpenStreetMap's raw answer: only the generated areas_osm.csv is needed.
data/osm
